            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Questions from patients about pain conditions and analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. In reply to a question about medication overuse headache, its presentation, causes, treatment, and prevention will be discussed.</AbstractText>
